rder-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\" class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW148319374 BCX0\">beautiful animated</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;\" class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148319374 BCX0\"> stories online. There are over 400 stories accessible on any device, phone, laptop &amp; tablet with a secure online log in. </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;\" class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148319374 BCX0\">We&rsquo;re</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;\" class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148319374 BCX0\"> offering educational, safe, and ad-free screentime that inspires a lifelong love of reading!</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\" class=\"EOP SCXW148319374 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">bank transfer / debit card&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Ask us if you have any more questions! Amazing opportunity to earn from this fantastic product :)</p>",
